  "metadata": "{\"compiler\":{\"version\":\"0.8.20+commit.a1b79de6\"},\"language\":\"Solidity\",\"output\":{\"abi\":[{\"anonymous\":false,\"inputs\":[{\"indexed\":true,\"internalType\":\"uint256\",\"name\":\"batchId\",\"type\":\"uint256\"},{\"indexed\":false,\"internalType\":\"bytes\",\"name\":\"ciphertext\",\"type\":\"bytes\"},{\"indexed\":true,\"internalType\":\"address\",\"name\":\"committer\",\"type\":\"address\"}],\"name\":\"BatchEncrypted\",\"type\":\"event\"},{\"anonymous\":false,\"inputs\":[{\"indexed\":true,\"internalType\":\"uint256\",\"name\":\"batchId\",\"type\":\"uint256\"},{\"indexed\":false,\"internalType\":\"string\",\"name\":\"key\",\"type\":\"string\"},{\"indexed\":true,\"internalType\":\"address\",\"name\":\"keyper\",\"type\":\"address\"}],\"name\":\"KeyPublished\",\"type\":\"event\"},{\"inputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"uint256\",\"name\":\"\",\"type\":\"uint256\"}],\"name\":\"decryptionKeys\",\"outputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"string\",\"name\":\"\",\"type\":\"string\"}],\"stateMutability\":\"view\",\"type\":\"function\"},{\"inputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"uint256\",\"name\":\"\",\"type\":\"uint256\"}],\"name\":\"encryptedBatches\",\"outputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"bytes\",\"name\":\"\",\"type\":\"bytes\"}],\"stateMutability\":\"view\",\"type\":\"function\"},{\"inputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"uint256\",\"name\":\"batchId\",\"type\":\"uint256\"}],\"name\":\"getBatchPayload\",\"outputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"bytes\",\"name\":\"\",\"type\":\"bytes\"},{\"internalType\":\"string\",\"name\":\"\",\"type\":\"string\"}],\"stateMutability\":\"view\",\"type\":\"function\"},{\"inputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"uint256\",\"name\":\"batchId\",\"type\":\"uint256\"}],\"name\":\"hasKey\",\"outputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"bool\",\"name\":\"\",\"type\":\"bool\"}],\"stateMutability\":\"view\",\"type\":\"function\"},{\"inputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"uint256\",\"name\":\"batchId\",\"type\":\"uint256\"},{\"internalType\":\"string\",\"name\":\"key\",\"type\":\"string\"}],\"name\":\"publishKey\",\"outputs\":[],\"stateMutability\":\"nonpayable\",\"type\":\"function\"},{\"inputs\":[{\"internalType\":\"uint256\",\"name\":\"batchId\",\"type\":\"uint256\"},{\"internalType\":\"bytes\",\"name\":\"ciphertext\",\"type\":\"bytes\"}],\"name\":\"submitEncryptedBatch\",\"outputs\":[],\"stateMutability\":\"nonpayable\",\"type\":\"function\"}],\"devdoc\":{\"details\":\"In production this would be an external network (Shutter/Ferveo) with BLS keys.\",\"kind\":\"dev\",\"methods\":{\"publishKey(uint256,string)\":{\"details\":\"For the hackathon, this is open; in production, restricted to a Keyper set.\"},\"submitEncryptedBatch(uint256,bytes)\":{\"params\":{\"batchId\":\"The batch identifier (must match AequitasCore).\",\"ciphertext\":\"Opaque encrypted data produced client-side.\"}}},\"stateVariables\":{\"decryptionKeys\":{\"details\":\"batchId => decryption key (plain string for the hackathon demo)\"},\"encryptedBatches\":{\"details\":\"batchId => encrypted blob (opaque bytes from frontend)\"}},\"title\":\"MockShutter\",\"version\":1},\"userdoc\":{\"kind\":\"user\",\"methods\":{\"getBatchPayload(uint256)\":{\"notice\":\"Convenience getter used by the off-chain Solver.\"},\"hasKey(uint256)\":{\"notice\":\"Returns plaintext-availability status for a batch.\"},\"publishKey(uint256,string)\":{\"notice\":\"Publish the decryption key after the batch is closed.\"},\"submitEncryptedBatch(uint256,bytes)\":{\"notice\":\"Store encrypted order-flow for a batch.\"}},\"notice\":\"Simulated threshold-encryption network for Aequitas-R.\",\"version\":1}},\"settings\":{\"compilationTarget\":{\"contracts/MockShutter.sol\":\"MockShutter\"},\"evmVersion\":\"paris\",\"libraries\":{},\"metadata\":{\"bytecodeHash\":\"ipfs\",\"useLiteralContent\":true},\"optimizer\":{\"enabled\":true,\"runs\":200},\"remappings\":[]},\"sources\":{\"contracts/MockShutter.sol\":{\"content\":\"// SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT\\r\\npragma solidity 0.8.20;\\r\\n\\r\\n/// @title MockShutter\\r\\n/// @notice Simulated threshold-encryption network for Aequitas-R.\\r\\n/// @dev In production this would be an external network (Shutter/Ferveo) with BLS keys.\\r\\ncontract MockShutter {\\r\\n    /// @dev batchId => encrypted blob (opaque bytes from frontend)\\r\\n    mapping(uint256 => bytes) public encryptedBatches;\\r\\n\\r\\n    /// @dev batchId => decryption key (plain string for the hackathon demo)\\r\\n    mapping(uint256 => string) public decryptionKeys;\\r\\n\\r\\n    event BatchEncrypted(uint256 indexed batchId, bytes ciphertext, address indexed committer);\\r\\n    event KeyPublished(uint256 indexed batchId, string key, address indexed keyper);\\r\\n\\r\\n    /// @notice Store encrypted order-flow for a batch.\\r\\n    /// @param batchId The batch identifier (must match AequitasCore).\\r\\n    /// @param ciphertext Opaque encrypted data produced client-side.\\r\\n    function submitEncryptedBatch(uint256 batchId, bytes calldata ciphertext) external {\\r\\n        // For simplicity, allow overwrite in demo; in prod, require empty slot.\\r\\n        encryptedBatches[batchId] = ciphertext;\\r\\n        emit BatchEncrypted(batchId, ciphertext, msg.sender);\\r\\n    }\\r\\n\\r\\n    /// @notice Publish the decryption key after the batch is closed.\\r\\n    /// @dev For the hackathon, this is open; in production, restricted to a Keyper set.\\r\\n    function publishKey(uint256 batchId, string calldata key) external {\\r\\n        decryptionKeys[batchId] = key;\\r\\n        emit KeyPublished(batchId, key, msg.sender);\\r\\n    }\\r\\n\\r\\n    /// @notice Returns plaintext-availability status for a batch.\\r\\n    function hasKey(uint256 batchId) external view returns (bool) {\\r\\n        return bytes(decryptionKeys[batchId]).length != 0;\\r\\n    }\\r\\n\\r\\n    /// @notice Convenience getter used by the off-chain Solver.\\r\\n    function getBatchPayload(uint256 batchId) external view returns (bytes memory, string memory) {\\r\\n        return (encryptedBatches[batchId], decryptionKeys[batchId]);\\r\\n    }\\r\\n}\\r\\n\",\"keccak256\":\"0x34a15f87643589a07b93fbdd06c11ae2d851a340b0e896e4367119ffc487f1f3\",\"license\":\"MIT\"}},\"version\":1}",
